# Flash Thompson, Spider-Fan: "When Flash Thompson enters, choose one or both" (CR 700.2). Bot1 attacks with an Ornithopter on
# turn 3 (it taps), then flashes Flash Thompson in: Heckle taps Bot2's Ornithopter (CR 701.26a) and Hero Worship untaps Bot1's
# attacker (CR 701.26b), each with its own target (CR 700.2c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Flash Thompson, Spider-Fan
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flash Thompson, Spider-Fan.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Stack.Count = 0
